.Dd February 27, 2026
.Dt CPP 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm cpp
.Nd C preprocessor front-end mode of Substrate cc
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op options
.Ar file
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
runs the C preprocessor stage and writes preprocessed source to standard output
by default.
In this toolchain,
.Nm
is installed as a symlink to
.Xr cc 1
and behaves as preprocess-only mode.
.Sh OPTIONS
Supports preprocessor and dependency options accepted by
.Xr cc 1 :
.Fl E ,
.Fl I ,
.Fl D ,
.Fl U ,
.Fl include ,
.Fl imacros ,
.Fl P ,
.Fl dM ,
.Fl M ,
.Fl MM ,
.Fl MD ,
.Fl MMD ,
.Fl MF ,
.Fl MT ,
.Fl MQ .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr cc 1
